''[[Frieren|Frieren: Beyond Journey's End]]'' is a Japanese [[manga]] series written by Kanehito Yamada and illustrated by [[Tsukasa Abe (manga artist)|Tsukasa Abe]]. It has been serialized in [[Shogakukan]]'s [[Shōnen manga|{{Transliteration|ja|shōnen}} manga]] magazine ''[[Weekly Shōnen Sunday]]'' since April 2020, with its chapters collected in 15 {{Transliteration|ja|[[tankōbon]]}} volumes as of December 2025. The series is licensed for English release in North America by [[Viz Media]],<ref>{{cite web|last=Mateo|first=Alex|title=Viz to Release Frieren: Beyond Journey's End, Mao, Rozen Blood, Burn the Witch, Animal Crossing, More Manga in Fall|url=https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2021-02-19/viz-to-release-frieren-beyond-journey-end-mao-rozen-blood-burn-the-witch-animal-crossing-more-manga-in-fall/.169708|website=[[Anime News Network]]|date=February 19, 2021|access-date=June 6, 2024|archive-date=February 19, 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210219200314/https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2021-02-19/viz-to-release-frieren-beyond-journey-end-mao-rozen-blood-burn-the-witch-animal-crossing-more-manga-in-fall/.169708|url-status=live}}</ref> while in Singapore by [[Shogakukan Asia]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Frieren: Remnants of the Departed|url=https://shogakukan.asia/frieren/|publisher=[[Shogakukan Asia]]|access-date=June 6, 2024|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230922145922/https://shogakukan.asia/frieren/|archive-date=September 22, 2023|url-status=live}}</ref>
